<title>NORWAY: Norway jobless rate falls to 3.5 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Norway jobless rate falls to 3.5 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 NOV 1996   OCT 1996    NOV 1995</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	   3.5	   3.6	   4.0</p>
<p> Unemployed			 77,100     79,346	 86,561</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			 88,688     89,392	99,893</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
